rypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Kemal\\Desktop\\Kemal\\WEBSİTE","sessionId":"f3ef876a-f062-4b29-bb81-775cc8a1a6d8","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"crystalline-crunching-moonbeam"}
{"parentUuid":"39b59d8d-e5f0-48b0-8f93-6564b886027f","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6b737603-8e34-4bc1-900a-7ec455b34b03","agentId":"aad420f0f6e87831c","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014WFMjAJKqKyjbhSUds8xnL","type":"tool_result","content":"      U_F tabanı: F kabini havası T_F 50 °C VARSAYIM → iki sac arası U 1,33 W/m²K (alt yüz kararlı katman h 2, üst yüz h 4) · alan 1,33 m²\n      U_F duvarları → oda: U 4 W/m²K × 2,4 m² (üst + ön + arka) · fan: 4414 FL serbest debi V_fan m³/h × filtre / ızgara verimi 0,65 (VARSAYIM) × e\n      pano dış yüzü: emiş jetinde v_pano m/s → h = 5,6 + 4,0·v (Jürges) + ışınım 1,5 · pano yanındaki hava = oda + ΔT_U / 2 (emiş tarafı)\"\"\"\n    rcp = 1.11 * 1007.0                                                        # J/m³K @ ~45 °C\n    T_U = T_oda + 2.0\n    for _ in range(30):\n        Pk = 2.0 * (0.300 + 0.200) * 0.3365\n        if yalitim:\n            Am = 2.0 * (0.325 + 0.225) * 0.332\n            U = 1.0 / (1.0 / 20.0 + BACA_YAL / 1000.0 / 0.040 + 1.0 / 5.0)\n            Q_baca = U * Am * (T_gaz - T_U)\n            T_yuzey = T_U + Q_baca / (5.0 * 2.0 * (0.351 + 0.251) * 0.332)\n        else:\n            U = 1.0 / (1.0 / 20.0 + 1.0 / 9.0); Q_baca = U * Pk * (T_gaz - T_U); T_yuzey = T_gaz - Q_baca / (20.0 * Pk)\n        Q_taban = 1.33 * 1.33 * (T_F - T_U)\n        Q_fan = 4 * 1.5\n        V = n_emis * V_fan * verim_filtre / 3600.0\n        dT = (Q_baca + P_pano + Q_taban + Q_fan) / (rcp * V + 4.0 * 2.4)\n        T_U = T_oda + dT\n    h_p = 5.6 + 4.0 * v_pano + 1.5\n    T_pano = T_oda + dT / 2.0 + P_pano / (h_p * A_pano)\n    return dict(T_oda=T_oda, T_gaz=T_gaz, yalitim=yalitim, Q_baca=round(Q_baca, 1), T_baca_yuzey=round(T_yuzey, 1), Q_taban=round(Q_taban, 1), P_pano=P_pano,\n                debi_m3h=round(V * 3600.0, 0), dT_UF=round(dT, 2), T_UF=round(T_U, 1), h_pano=round(h_p, 1), T_pano_ic=round(T_pano, 1))\n\n\ndef icecek():\n    \"\"\"U_KE: raf (1,5) + 4 taşıyıcı profil (koli aralarının altında) + 6 koli\"\"\"\n    global RAF_KIRIS_X\n    k = KUTULAR[2]; x0, x1 = k[\"x\"]\n    ic0, ic1 = x0 + SAC, x1 - SAC\n    gen = 3 * KOLI[\"x\"] + 2 * KOLI_ARA","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"74c0e25a-bfb5-4a0c-a08e-44292a05e307","timestamp":"2026-10-01T23:47:05.575Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"39b59d8d-e5f0-48b0-8f93-6564b886027f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Kemal\\Desktop\\Kemal\\WEBSİTE","sessionId":"f3ef876a-f062-4b29-bb81-775cc8a1a6d8","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"crystalline-crunching-moonbeam"}
