{"parentUuid":"4166df3e-35b1-4f12-b8c7-f30dc196ad99","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"2aed641f-acb0-4068-86c1-949048cfd89c","agentId":"aad420f0f6e87831c","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NrgcUSujZizT7Fz8cLQ78K","type":"tool_result","content":"derlendi\nOK    1  yama_v37_k_sac.py\r\nKURU: 15 yama · 0 sorunlu · dosya YAZILMADI\r\nsurum=\"v3.7\"                                                                               1\r\nhat3_v6                                                                                    0\r\nZİNCİR + COMPILE TAMAM · hiçbir dosya yazılmadı\r\nv7 metni: [('v7 KP.bolge_K → KSAC', 1), ('K_GOVDE + govde_', 1), ('K_GOVDE metni', 1), ('v7 süpürme engelleri KS dünya', 1), ('v7 süpürme K kapağı bileşik', 1)] · derlendi · +360 karakter\r\nv7 sonrası sayım: KP.bolge_K 0 · KSAC.uygula_ks 1 · govde_ öneki 1 · kapak_dunya 1 · dunya_listesi 2 → TAMAM\r\nls: cannot access '/c/Users/Kemal/AppData/Local/Temp/claude/C--Users-Kemal-Desktop-Kemal-WEBS-TE/f3ef876a-f062-4b29-bb81-775cc8a1a6d8/scratchpad/b3/arastirma/_uretec/h3/hat3_montaj_v7.py': No such file or directory","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"8f08a7c5-b6d2-4abb-b3aa-1c4077b3fdcb","timestamp":"2026-10-02T00:06:25.477Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"4166df3e-35b1-4f12-b8c7-f30dc196ad99","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Kemal\\Desktop\\Kemal\\WEBSİTE","sessionId":"f3ef876a-f062-4b29-bb81-775cc8a1a6d8","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"crystalline-crunching-moonbeam"}
{"parentUuid":"8f08a7c5-b6d2-4abb-b3aa-1c4077b3fdcb","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"aad420f0f6e87831c","attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14533779 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"5e266ba7-77d4-4fe5-8f0f-d2a5c2d1deeb","timestamp":"2026-10-02T00:06:25.483Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14533779 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Kemal\\Desktop\\Kemal\\WEBSİTE","sessionId":"f3ef876a-f062-4b29-bb81-775cc8a1a6d8","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"crystalline-crunching-moonbeam"}
{"parentUuid":"5e266ba7-77d4-4fe5-8f0f-d2a5c2d1deeb","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"aad420f0f6e87831c","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfcSBNKrEJsLpixfmHRpc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I fixed the coordinate errors and every region now passes. B, A, U, F, E and TOPPING were built on their own (K with the pilot's sac model): new door positions are correct, there are no new collisions and the door-opening sweeps are clean. The montaj itself was not run and `hat3_montaj_v7.py` was not written. The patcher's dry run shows 15 of 15 anchors matching, and the pilot patch applies to the v7 text and compiles.\n\n**Which frame each module lives in**\n\n| Module | Frame in the montaj | Was the door code right? |\n|---|---|---|\n| SC (B) | world | Yes. The seam value and the depo gasket were wrong, now fixed |\n| AK (A), UD (U), FU (F) | world | Frame yes. A hit its own frame when opening, now fixed |\n| KC (E) | local, world x = local x + 4400 | **No, written in world coordinates.** Fixed |\n| KS (K) | local, + X_K | Handled by the pilot patch; I did not touch `bolge_K` |\n| TU (TOPPING cold door) | x − 700, y and z world | Yes |\n| TC (TOPPING mechanism wing) | local, + (700, 892) | Yes |\n\n**What I changed in `h3_kapak_v1.py`**\n- **E:** dimensions are worked out in world coordinates and written to the parts in E-local (−X_E). The robot-bin flap cut-out now uses E's own `KC.klape_cebi()`. The latches were buried inside the new middle post, so they now sit in pockets cut into it.\n- **B:** I had the seam at 454/456. It is now 453.5/456.5, which matches the K6 drawer seam exactly (drawers unchanged). Shifting the whole depo gasket up 8 mm would have hit the depo ceiling, so only its bottom leg moves up 8 mm and the inner sheet stays put.\n- **A:** the door now copies the original's hinge-side relief (returns stop at z 62). Without it the door hit the left post and the U_A side wall when opening.\n- **F:** I had moved the F latch up to 2130, which collided with the U_F side sheet. Instead, U_F's existing latch stays and the F latch is removed; the strike plate moves to the top.\n\n**What I changed in `yap_hat3_montaj_v7.py`**\n- The A and E calls now pass the new parameters (A's hinge-side relief, E's offset and flap cut-out).\n- The opening sweep now converts every module into world coordinates:\n  - E is shifted by +X_E, and K by +X_K unless the pilot's world list is used.\n  - TC parts are added as obstacles.\n  - A is swept as its whole door group around its real hinge axis (`AK.MENTESE`).\n  - The robot-bin flap and chute swing with the lower-left E door, so they are not obstacles.\n  - Parts that move with the K door are excluded from the obstacles.\n  - It asserts that each hinge axis lies on the door edge and that the TOPPING shell is the merged one in world coordinates.\n- I kept the exact text the pilot patch looks for (`(KS, KS.PARCALAR) …` and `_K37 = …`).\n- `yama_v37_k_sac.py` is added to the loop in block 9, and the pilot patch is copied into h3 under that name. I left the fire/pizza patches alone.\n\n**Test results**\n\n| Test | Collisions | Opening sweep | Peak memory |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| B | none | — | not measured |\n| A + U + F | none (24 new parts vs 122 fixed) | A 10–100° and both F flaps 0–90°: clean | 482 MB |\n| E | none, before or after (28 new vs 221 fixed) | 4 doors clean; flap and robot mouth tunnel clear | 662 MB |\n| TOPPING | merged shell is one valid solid; nothing hit, including its own PU/gasket/hardware (93 obstacles) | both doors clean | **2.3 GB** |\n| K (pilot) + U_KE | — | clean (507 obstacles) | 421 MB |\n\nThe TOPPING test went over the 1 GB budget; it is finished and nothing is left running. New door weights: TOPPING merged shell 11.4 kg, A door group 14.1 kg, F doors 10.1 kg each.\n\n**Still open**\n- The montaj run (v7 build, its own checks, the new sweep) is still to be done.\n- The sweep only rotates the TOPPING door's outer shell. Its gasket and PU moving with it were already covered by the module's own sweep.\n\nTest scripts (`t_*.py`, `t_zincir.py`) and copies of the two files are in `scratchpad\\kapak_v37\\`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1017,"cache_read_input_tokens":465673,"output_tokens":1585,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1017},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1585,"cache_read_input_tokens":465673,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1017,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1017,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfcSBMPnwJi2m6dDq98jK","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"be962a68-b24d-44d4-8982-00f4f956e029","timestamp":"2026-10-02T00:06:42.081Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Kemal\\Desktop\\Kemal\\WEBSİTE","sessionId":"f3ef876a-f062-4b29-bb81-775cc8a1a6d8","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"crystalline-crunching-moonbeam"}
